OL,3,CTyson Fury claims heavyweight showdown
OL,4,Cwith Anthony Joshua is in doubt
OL,6,FBut shortly after the contest was
OL,7,Fannounced last week, Matchroom Sport
OL,8,Fchairman Hearn disputed White's
OL,9,Finvolvement after the American boss of
OL,10,Fthe UFC and Zuffa Boxing was
OL,11,Fofficially named as a promoter
OL,12,Falongside The Ring, which is owned by
OL,13,FSaudi Arabian powerbroker Turki
OL,14,FAlalshikh.
OL,16,FHearn and White have been at
OL,17,Floggerheads for months amid a bitter
OL,18,Fdisagreement over where the fight
OL,19,Fshould take place, and Fury warned it
OL,20,Fis now in jeopardy because of Joshua's
OL,21,Flong-term promoter.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
