OL,3,CTyson Fury claims heavyweight showdown
OL,4,Cwith Anthony Joshua is in doubt
OL,6,FFury said: "Breaking news. Anthony
OL,7,FJoshua and Eddie Hearn are trying to
OL,8,Fpull out of this fight. They're saying
OL,9,Fthey're not gonna fight now. They're
OL,10,Flittle ********* cowards.
OL,12,F"It's mainly to do with Eddie Hearn's
OL,13,Fego. He's making up a million
OL,14,Fdifferent things and threatening
OL,15,F'we're not gonna fight, we're not
OL,16,Fgonna fight, we're not gonna fight'.
OL,17,FHe's cost us the biggest fight in
OL,18,Fboxing history. Clown."
