OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FMultiple attempts to arrange the
OL,12,Fhighest-grossing event in British
OL,13,Fboxing history have failed, most
OL,14,Fnotably in 2021 when Deontay Wilder
OL,15,Fused arbitration to force a trilogy
OL,16,Ffight with Fury when the 'Gypsy King'
OL,17,Fhad a signed contract with Joshua.
