OL,3,CTyson Fury claims heavyweight showdown
OL,4,Cwith Anthony Joshua is in doubt
OL,6,FMonths of wrangling that saw Croke
OL,7,FPark, Wembley, Madison Square Garden
OL,8,Fand then the successful venue of
OL,9,FCardiff's Principality Stadium come
OL,10,Finto contention for the latest attempt
OL,11,Fto resurrect their meeting finally
OL,12,Fappeared on Thursday.
OL,14,FFury has suggested that alternative
OL,15,Fopponents to Joshua are now being
OL,16,Flined up for him.
OL,18,FHe said: "AJ, pull your finger out you
OL,19,Flittle white-flagged, yellow-bellied
OL,20,Fcoward. Now I'm coming home.
