OL,6,F"The Gypsy King is coming back to the
OL,7,FUnited Kingdom to thrash you in front
OL,8,Fof all my fans in Wales, you absolute
OL,9,Flittle nugget, bodybuilding sausage.
OL,11,F"Now you're making a million excuses.
OL,12,FNow you've got Turki Alalshikh finding
OL,13,Falternative real men who will fight at
OL,14,Fthe drop of a hat.
OL,16,F"So I hope yous are happy, you little
OL,17,Fcowardly "*******. I've never seen
OL,18,Fanything like you. You're pure
OL,19,F"********** and this is mainly to do
OL,20,Fwith Eddie Hearn's ego. What a little
OL,21,F"****."
